
  ▲ waiver-missing-reason  Waiver without a reason
    warning · integrity

  A narc:allow comment must say why the waived change is acceptable.

  How to fix
    Add a reason: narc:allow <rule> reason="why this is fine (link to
    issue)"

  Docs:
  https://github.com/huyth45/narc/blob/main/docs/rules.md#waiver-missing-reason

